 "notes": [
  "Painted design: pale silver-blue steel plates (body, head, legs) with soft painted shading and a fine painted grain, dark blue-grey metal on neck and thighs, silver wing blades with red undersides, pale beak and claw tips. _par is BC3 and its alpha is authored: about 87/255 on the body, 255 on the wing blades and their red undersides; the wing shader carries metal_coef / Metal_wing parameters.",
  "So: polished steel: the painted grain only, very low, plus the painted soft panel shading; lower roughness and a slightly higher spec mask so reflections tighten; wing blades smoother still; red undersides painted metal, same; beak and claw tips untouched; _par alpha (metallic) kept exactly as authored (not raised: which of the body and wing shaders read .w could not be checked locally).",
  "Body shader 2539709756 and wing shader 2752675853 have no normal sampler: in game only _dif and _par load; Body_nor is cache-only."
